Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:01.30,Alt,,0,0,0,,Hadi aşkım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.60,Alt,,0,0,0,,Toplantın var.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.20,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sayın Muhtar…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:13.50,Alt,,0,0,0,,Rıza ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:15.60,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeni ortağınız.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:18.20,Alt,,0,0,0,,Şalteri kapatıyoruz, tasarrufu paylaşıyoruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:19.45,Alt,,0,0,0,,Kazan kazan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:22.58,Alt,,0,0,0,,Öncekiler slayt getirmişti.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:27.48,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bakın, fatura burada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.23,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç yüz otuz üç bin—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:37.18,Alt,,0,0,0,,Koş Rıza, koş!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:39.18,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yetişemez.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:42.08,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sayın Muhtar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:43.58,Alt,,0,0,0,,Muhtar Bey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:44.98,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bir dakika!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:48.43,Alt,,0,0,0,,Ver bakayım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:51.98,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sen kimsin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:53.88,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeni… sahip…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:55.18,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sahip mi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:59.23,Alt,,0,0,0,,Şalter Muhtar'da.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:00.53,Alt,,0,0,0,,Muhtar bende.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:01.98,Alt,,0,0,0,,Anahtar da burada.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:03.53,Alt,,0,0,0,,Verir misiniz?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:05.78,Alt,,0,0,0,,Veririm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:06.98,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bir şartla.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.03,0:01:11.48,KutuKoyu,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1290)\frz2\fscx70\fscy70\t(0,140,\fscx106\fscy106)\t(140,220,\fscx100\fscy100)}EMİNE'NİN ŞARTI NE?
